  "title": "Unity Bancorp Reports Quarterly Earnings of $14.3 Million",
  "summary": "CLINTON, N.J., April 14, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) - Unity Bancorp, Inc. (NASDAQ: UNTY), parent company of Unity Bank, reported net income of $14.3 million, or $1.40 per diluted share, for the quarter ended March 31, 2026, compared to net income of $15.5 million, or $1.52 per diluted share for the quarter ended December 31, 2025. James A. Hughes, CEO, commented on the financial results: “We are pleased to report another strong quarter for Unity Bancorp, Inc., highlighted by solid profitability and c",
